%%   `subprocess` without a shell does not, because CreateProcess searches for
%%   the literal name and name+.exe only. So on a machine where mermaid-cli WAS
%%   installed, the call raised an uncaught WinError 2 - and MMDC_MISSING,
%%   the message written for exactly that moment, never printed, because
